+- 文件版本：0.17.4.1。程序未进行发行代码签名。
+- `build-rewrite.cmd` 构建两个架构；需先准备 `weasel.props`、Boost 静态库、
+  librime 头文件与导入库。源码与测试位于此仓库。
+
+依赖来源：https://github.com/rime/librime/releases/tag/1.17.0
+及 https://archives.boost.io/release/1.84.0/source/boost_1_84_0.zip 。
diff --git a/rewrite-ui.custom.example.yaml b/rewrite-ui.custom.example.yaml
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..793fe0b
--- /dev/null
+++ b/rewrite-ui.custom.example.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# Merge these keys into the EXISTING patch map of weasel.custom.yaml.
+# Do not replace your theme or existing settings.
+patch:
+  rewrite_ui/enabled: true
+  rewrite_ui/debug: false
+# Existing theme settings control native rewrite cells:
+# hilited_back_color, hilited_text_color, text_color,
+# style/layout/corner_radius, hilite_padding_x/y and hilite_spacing.
+# The index badge uses one third of the highlight background opacity.
